	<section_number>1-212</section_number>
	<catch_line>Courts of record</catch_line>
	<text>
		"Courts of record" means the Supreme Court of Virginia, the Court of Appeals of Virginia, and the circuit courts.
	</text>
	<history>1971, Ex. Sess., c. 49, § 1-13.5:1; 2005, c. 839.</history>
